  "body": "@mystor raised a good point that supporting SharedArrayBuffer in BroadcastChannel puts pressure on really getting the \"agent cluster\" definition correct. E.g., if you put two same-origin tabs in the same agent cluster, they can suddenly share memory, even if they cannot synchronously access each other. That seems bad and given that it's rather error prone, perhaps we're better off disabling SharedArrayBuffer there?",
